  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LLM 请求 QPS",
      "description": "各模型/调用来源（ainvoke/invoke）的成功请求速率，反映 LLM 调用整体负载。异常排查：\n1. 确认数据源正常：Prometheus Targets 中 stock-agent 是否 up，/metrics 是否能抓到 llm_requests_total。\n2. QPS 归零：检查服务是否存活、调用路径是否改走其他入口（代码里是否还走 invoke_with_metrics/ainvoke_with_metrics）。\n3. QPS 暴涨：对照错误率面板，若同步上升可能是失败重试风暴（如网络抖动导致指数退避重试）。\n4. 修复后观察 1~2 个抓取周期内 QPS 恢复；归零且服务正常时检查调用点是否被新代码绕过。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (model, source) (rate(llm_requests_total{model=~\"$model\", source=~\"$source\", status=\"ok\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} {{source}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LLM 错误数",
      "description": "各模型的失败调用速率；持续非 0 说明模型服务异常、超时或限流。异常排查：\n1. 从日志定位错误码：docker compose logs stock-agent | grep -iE 'llm|deepseek|error'，区分超时/401/429/500。\n2. 401/403：检查 API Key 配置（.env.prod 中 DEEPSEEK_API_KEY 等）是否失效或过期。\n3. 429/限流：检查账户额度与并发，降低并发或加退避重试；500/超时：检查模型服务端状态和网络。\n4. 按 model/source 维度拆分确认是否集中在某个模型，修复后观察错误归零。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (model) (rate(llm_requests_total{model=~\"$model\", status=\"error\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "LLM 整体错误率",
      "description": "LLM 调用中失败占比，正常应接近 0；持续大于 1% 需要立即排查。异常排查：\n1. 看趋势排除瞬时抖动，确认是否持续 5 分钟以上。\n2. 检查是否伴随 QPS 暴涨（重试风暴会放大错误率），必要时先熔断/降级再排查根因。\n3. 检查账户余额/配额（deepseek 平台）、API key 状态、网络到模型服务的连通性。\n4. 修复后观察错误率回落；若反复出现，考虑给 LLM 调用加超时、重试上限和熔断。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(llm_requests_total{model=~\"$model\", status=\"error\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(llm_requests_total{model=~\"$model\"}[$__rate_interval]))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.01
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LLM 延迟 P50/P95",
      "description": "每次 LLM 调用的耗时分位（按模型/来源），直接反映模型响应速度与慢调用分布。异常排查：\n1. 确认是否伴随错误率上升：超时重试会同时推高延迟和错误。\n2. 按 model/source 拆开定位：是特定模型慢还是全量慢（模型服务端负载、网络跨地域）。\n3. 检查输入长度：超长 prompt（如注入的记忆上下文过大）会显著增加首 token 时间，对照\"注入上下文长度\"面板。\n4. 优化方向：换更快模型、压缩上下文、降低并发争抢；修复后观察 P50/P95 回落。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum(rate(llm_request_duration_seconds_bucket{model=~\"$model\", source=~\"$source\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (le, model, source))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} {{source}} p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(llm_request_duration_seconds_bucket{model=~\"$model\", source=~\"$source\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (le, model, source))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} {{source}} p95"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LLM Token 消耗速率",
      "description": "按类型（input/output/reasoning）的 token 消耗速率，用于估算成本与上下文用量。异常排查：\n1. 拆开看哪类在涨：input 涨查注入上下文（对照 memory_recall_prompt_chars）；output 涨查回答长度；reasoning 涨查是否误开了推理/思考模式。\n2. 确认是否调用次数上涨（对照 LLM 请求 QPS），次数和单次用量要分开看。\n3. 检查是否有循环或重复调用场景（Agent 多轮反思、评估反复打分）放大消耗。\n4. 优化提示词、压缩上下文、缓存常用结果后，观察速率斜率放缓。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (type) (rate(llm_tokens_total{model=~\"$model\", source=~\"$source\", type!=\"total\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{type}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LLM Token 按模型",
      "description": "各模型按 token 类型的消耗对比，快速定位成本大头和推理占比。异常排查：\n1. 确认是某模型调用量涨还是单次 token 涨：对照该模型的 QPS 和延迟面板。\n2. 看该模型的调用场景（source 标签：memory_write、eval、supervisor 等），定位成本来源。\n3. 若推理模型占比过高：评估是否业务真的需要推理，考虑降级到普通模型。\n4. 优化后观察该模型消耗占比下降；必要时按模型设置成本告警。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (model, type) (rate(llm_tokens_total{model=~\"$model\", source=~\"$source\", type!=\"total\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} {{type}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
